		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Rocket Boots</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — Leap 8 spaces free of Restrained/Grappled with no fall damage.</em></p><p><strong>1 Action.</strong> Lose Restrained/Grappled and leap 8 spaces. You take no fall damage.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Burst 1, Damage: 5+LVL around your starting space and on landing. On hit: inflict Smoldering. Ignores armor.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Take half damage from falling.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls Burst 1, 5+LVL damage (ignores armor) and applies Smoldering to the targets.</em></p><p><em>[M] The book gives no damage type; Fire is assumed (it inflicts Smoldering).</em></p><p><em>[M] The burst goes off around your starting space AND on landing — target the first group, then apply the same roll to the second.</em></p>",
